WEBVTT

00:05.887 --> 00:07.557
<b>-[Sitara cries]
-[SHIRA] Hey! Listen!</b>

00:07.597 --> 00:10.387
<b>You want to get that book back,
don't you?</b>

00:14.727 --> 00:16.147
<b>[Sitara gasps softly]</b>

00:17.607 --> 00:18.947
<b>Huh?</b>

00:20.357 --> 00:22.947
<b>[♪ opening theme song playing]</b>

01:49.287 --> 01:50.827
<b>[battle cry]</b>

01:52.247 --> 01:53.617
<b>[SITARA (ADULT)]
The thirteenth century</b>

01:53.787 --> 01:56.707
<b>saw the rise of a vast empire
that swept across Eurasia.</b>

01:57.377 --> 01:59.917
<b>Genghis Khan,
the "universal ruler."</b>

02:00.547 --> 02:02.757
<b>He was hailed as the Great Khan,</b>

02:02.797 --> 02:06.337
<b>as he and his kin
built the Mongol Empire.</b>

02:07.007 --> 02:09.467
<b>Although the Mongols were
originally a small,</b>

02:09.507 --> 02:12.807
<b>nomadic tribe,
by the year 1206,</b>

02:12.847 --> 02:15.387
<b>they had conquered
the other steppe tribes</b>

02:15.437 --> 02:17.307
<b>and become a major power.</b>

02:17.557 --> 02:21.227
<b>A short time later, they began
advancing even further.</b>

02:21.277 --> 02:23.317
<b>Foraying into
the various nations</b>

02:23.357 --> 02:24.817
<b>that bordered the steppes.</b>

02:29.237 --> 02:30.327
<b>Greetings, my brothers.</b>

02:30.367 --> 02:31.747
<b>[ALL] Tolui.</b>

02:33.957 --> 02:34.997
<b>[slurps]</b>

02:35.497 --> 02:36.917
<b>Haven't you drunk enough?</b>

02:37.877 --> 02:39.087
<b>Welcome back.</b>

02:41.047 --> 02:42.627
<b>[Tolui laughs]</b>

02:43.257 --> 02:45.297
<b>How was the Khwarazm campaign?</b>

02:46.717 --> 02:48.677
<b>It went well, except,</b>

02:48.717 --> 02:51.217
<b>we lost quite a few soldiers.</b>

02:51.467 --> 02:52.557
<b>The shame is mine.</b>

02:52.597 --> 02:54.267
<b>Your indecision is to blame.</b>

02:54.307 --> 02:56.937
<b>You simply had to follow
Father's orders, Jochi.</b>

02:56.977 --> 02:58.727
<b>[ÖGEDEI] That's enough, you two.</b>

02:59.057 --> 03:01.977
<b>What about you, Tolui?
You were in Persia, right?</b>

03:02.777 --> 03:06.607
<b>Indeed. I brought honor to
Genghis Khan's name in battle.</b>

03:06.657 --> 03:07.657
<b>[laughs]</b>

03:07.947 --> 03:10.907
<b>Fitting for the Otchigin.
Our future emperor.</b>

03:18.417 --> 03:21.207
<b>[TOLUI] Not to mention,
I acquired something good.</b>

03:24.127 --> 03:25.627
<b>A foreign book, huh?</b>

03:25.667 --> 03:27.547
<b>I am told it's called Elements.</b>

03:27.587 --> 03:28.587
<b>♪</b>

03:28.637 --> 03:30.137
<b>[TOLUI] Before leaving home,</b>

03:30.177 --> 03:32.097
<b>my wife asked me for this book
as a token</b>

03:32.137 --> 03:33.557
<b>of my conquests.</b>

03:33.597 --> 03:35.097
<b>What a modest woman!</b>

03:35.137 --> 03:36.597
<b>After all,
she could have asked me</b>

03:36.637 --> 03:39.517
<b>to bring back gold
or rare jewels instead.</b>

03:40.727 --> 03:42.227
<b>She's so very special to me.</b>

03:42.267 --> 03:44.527
<b>I'd do anything just
to make her smile.</b>

03:44.567 --> 03:45.897
<b>[Ögedei whistles]</b>

03:45.937 --> 03:47.607
<b>So what's written
on these pages?</b>

03:47.647 --> 03:48.817
<b>[TOLUI] Hm?</b>

03:50.987 --> 03:52.197
<b>I have no clue.</b>

03:52.237 --> 03:53.657
<b>[ALL] Uh...</b>

03:53.737 --> 03:57.117
<b>Oh, so you have a scholar
who can explain its contents?</b>

03:57.157 --> 03:58.167
<b>[TOLUI] No.</b>

03:58.207 --> 03:59.707
<b>Can your wife read tomes</b>

03:59.747 --> 04:01.167
<b>that are written
in foreign tongues?</b>

04:01.207 --> 04:03.837
<b>[TOLUI] Not that I know of.
[laughs]</b>

04:03.877 --> 04:05.207
<b>[ÖGEDEI] Oh, dear.</b>

04:08.047 --> 04:10.427
<b>[SHIRA] See,
I'm planning on introducing you</b>

04:10.467 --> 04:12.297
<b>to Prince Tolui
as soon as possible.</b>

04:13.047 --> 04:15.097
<b>You're a scholar's daughter,
aren't you?</b>

04:15.347 --> 04:17.557
<b>I would've preferred
to volunteer myself,</b>

04:17.597 --> 04:20.097
<b>but I can only read
and write a few simple things.</b>

04:20.807 --> 04:23.107
<b>I do pick up
new languages quickly, though.</b>

04:24.897 --> 04:27.687
<b>[SITARA] Why did she even
want that book, anyway?</b>

04:27.737 --> 04:28.947
<b>[SHIRA] Hm?</b>

04:28.987 --> 04:31.617
<b>-Uh, I don't know.
-She can't read the words.</b>

04:31.657 --> 04:34.527
<b>[SHIRA] And she asked for it
instead of gold or silver.</b>

04:34.577 --> 04:36.117
<b>Strange, to be sure.</b>

04:36.617 --> 04:39.867
<b>Still, this is your chance
to serve the imperial family.</b>

04:39.907 --> 04:42.247
<b>And to have that book back
in your hands again.</b>

04:42.287 --> 04:44.377
<b>Doesn't sound
like too bad a deal,</b>

04:44.417 --> 04:46.377
<b>wouldn't you say? [gasps]</b>

04:47.297 --> 04:49.127
<b>[SITARA] The Mongol emperor?</b>

04:49.167 --> 04:51.007
<b>Serve his family?</b>

04:51.177 --> 04:54.467
<b>No. That aside, worse still.</b>

04:55.347 --> 04:58.557
<b>[TOLUI] Before leaving home,
my wife asked me for this book.</b>

05:01.637 --> 05:05.897
<b>[SITARA] My mistress died
over such a trifle?</b>

05:06.937 --> 05:11.067
<b>So, um, what happened was
most unfortunate.</b>

05:11.487 --> 05:13.447
<b>And I do regret it.</b>

05:13.487 --> 05:15.947
<b>But I didn't have a choice.</b>

05:15.987 --> 05:17.907
<b>I'm doing everything I can</b>

05:17.947 --> 05:19.577
<b>to try and get
in their good favor.</b>

05:19.617 --> 05:22.577
<b>I don't ever want to be sent
to the front lines.</b>

05:22.617 --> 05:25.287
<b>Boys who are around my age
end up at the very front</b>

05:25.327 --> 05:28.627
<b>of their expedition armies...
as human shields.</b>

05:28.667 --> 05:30.587
<b>-[Sitara exhales]
-[battle cry]</b>

05:31.087 --> 05:32.257
<b>I see.</b>

05:32.797 --> 05:34.967
<b>You're too young
to grow a beard,</b>

05:35.007 --> 05:36.177
<b>yet they took you?</b>

05:36.217 --> 05:37.557
<b>Yes, that's right.</b>

05:37.597 --> 05:39.887
<b>-No, enough talk of the past!
-[gasps softly]</b>

05:39.927 --> 05:42.097
<b>This is my big chance
to move up in the world.</b>

05:42.137 --> 05:43.637
<b>For the first time,</b>

05:43.687 --> 05:46.897
<b>a path to success based on merit
has opened up to us.</b>

05:46.937 --> 05:49.727
<b>I will do whatever it takes
to thrive and succeed.</b>

05:49.777 --> 05:52.357
<b>Now you can finally
make the most of your education.</b>

05:52.397 --> 05:54.817
<b>Well, that and your
fetching face.</b>

05:54.867 --> 05:56.657
<b>If all the stars become aligned,</b>

05:56.697 --> 05:58.327
<b>one day, you could become
an attendant</b>

05:58.367 --> 05:59.827
<b>to a high-ranking figure.</b>

06:00.197 --> 06:01.287
<b>Mm?</b>

06:01.447 --> 06:04.577
<b>Her smile is quite fetching,
as you can see!</b>

06:05.707 --> 06:08.417
<b>[SHIRA] That's the very reason
you ought to do something.</b>

06:08.457 --> 06:10.167
<b>But what exactly?</b>

06:10.797 --> 06:12.217
<b>How could I possibly know</b>

06:12.257 --> 06:15.337
<b>what course of action
I'm supposed to take here?</b>

06:16.137 --> 06:17.797
<b>What should I do?</b>

06:21.807 --> 06:22.927
<b>[MUHAMMAD]
But if one were to study</b>

06:22.977 --> 06:24.637
<b>and become wise,
then one would know</b>

06:24.687 --> 06:26.227
<b>the best course of action
to take,</b>

06:26.267 --> 06:27.937
<b>no matter what the problem
might be.</b>

06:27.977 --> 06:29.227
<b>That's always.</b>

06:29.267 --> 06:30.727
<b>[Sitara breathes shakily]</b>

06:31.527 --> 06:32.607
<b>[Sitara grunts]</b>

06:34.067 --> 06:35.317
<b>[SHIRA] Uh?</b>

06:38.947 --> 06:40.277
<b>♪</b>

06:41.487 --> 06:42.617
<b>[Shira exhales softly]</b>

06:42.827 --> 06:45.037
<b>[SITARA] I am well-versed
in ancient wisdom</b>

06:45.077 --> 06:47.167
<b>and modern teachings alike.</b>

06:47.537 --> 06:49.037
<b>Needless to say,</b>

06:49.497 --> 06:52.207
<b>I am able to read
Euclid's Elements.</b>

06:54.007 --> 06:55.467
<b>And you're right.</b>

06:57.137 --> 07:01.137
<b>I want to lead a cushy life,
eating amazing food every day.</b>

07:04.807 --> 07:06.767
<b>This is my chance!</b>

07:06.807 --> 07:09.897
<b>If the both of us work together,
then we can make it happen!</b>

07:09.937 --> 07:11.437
<b>Uh, yeah.</b>

07:12.227 --> 07:14.147
<b>So, um, my name's Shira.</b>

07:14.187 --> 07:16.027
<b>-Mm?
-And I'm from Samarkand.</b>

07:17.067 --> 07:18.777
<b>My name's Sitara.</b>

07:18.817 --> 07:20.367
<b>Sitara?</b>

07:20.407 --> 07:23.367
<b>Hold on.
With a garish name like that...</b>

07:23.407 --> 07:24.947
<b>Yes, I am a slave.</b>

07:24.997 --> 07:26.117
<b>And what of it?</b>

07:26.327 --> 07:27.997
<b>[Shira sighs]</b>

07:28.577 --> 07:30.377
<b>[SHIRA]
We're in a new social order,</b>

07:30.417 --> 07:32.957
<b>but being well-born
still gets you a long way.</b>

07:32.997 --> 07:36.717
<b>Especially when dealing
with the imperial family.</b>

07:36.757 --> 07:39.047
<b>Well, you can just lie.</b>

07:39.427 --> 07:41.307
<b>Let's go with
a more dignified name.</b>

07:41.347 --> 07:42.717
<b>[Sitara chuckles softly]</b>

07:43.097 --> 07:44.807
<b>In that case...</b>

07:57.947 --> 07:59.067
<b>[in English] Listen,</b>

07:59.317 --> 08:02.027
<b>anybody who's granted
an audience with the Mongols</b>

08:02.067 --> 08:04.157
<b>must pass between two fires.</b>

08:04.197 --> 08:05.327
<b>'Cause they all believe</b>

08:05.367 --> 08:07.407
<b>fire has the power
to purify evil.</b>

08:08.327 --> 08:10.127
<b>[SITARA] A heathen ritual, huh?</b>

08:17.507 --> 08:19.257
<b>[SHIRA] Also,
you must never step</b>

08:19.297 --> 08:20.717
<b>on the entrance's threshold.</b>

08:21.257 --> 08:23.137
<b>If you do,
you'll be put to death.</b>

08:48.367 --> 08:50.157
<b>[in English]
"Greetings, scholar's daughter.</b>

08:50.207 --> 08:52.077
<b>I am glad to see
you're still alive,</b>

08:52.127 --> 08:53.877
<b>so says His Highness,"
he says.</b>

09:10.387 --> 09:11.937
<b>[Sitara, in English]
My name is...</b>

09:15.107 --> 09:17.897
<b>Fatima, Your Highness.</b>

09:17.937 --> 09:19.317
<b>♪</b>

09:25.027 --> 09:28.157
<b>[SITARA (ADULT)] These fires
won't ever erase them.</b>

09:30.157 --> 09:31.657
<b>Not those tender days</b>

09:31.707 --> 09:34.127
<b>that only exist
in my memories now.</b>

09:34.997 --> 09:38.757
<b>Nor my ties to the mistress,
and the others.</b>

09:39.917 --> 09:42.217
<b>If there's one thing I know
I can still do,</b>

09:42.257 --> 09:44.587
<b>it's taking that book back.</b>

09:45.467 --> 09:49.517
<b>Until that day, I shall remain
my mistress' slave.</b>

09:50.307 --> 09:52.177
<b>[wind blows]</b>

10:06.277 --> 10:08.867
<b>Well, I have avoided a fate
on the front lines,</b>

10:08.907 --> 10:11.117
<b>thanks to the commander's
good word. Huh?</b>

10:11.617 --> 10:13.287
<b>Is she Tolui's wife?</b>

10:13.327 --> 10:14.787
<b>No. Princess Sorghaghtani</b>

10:14.827 --> 10:16.877
<b>should be at the Mongols'
home camp right now,</b>

10:16.917 --> 10:18.627
<b>so that definitely isn't her
over there.</b>

10:19.337 --> 10:21.007
<b>I wonder
who she could be, then.</b>

10:21.047 --> 10:22.587
<b>One of the generals' wives?</b>

10:22.717 --> 10:23.797
<b>[SITARA] What?</b>

10:24.087 --> 10:26.507
<b>The Mongols always bring
quite a few women with them,</b>

10:26.547 --> 10:28.507
<b>even out
on military expeditions.</b>

10:28.547 --> 10:30.347
<b>Women on an expedition?</b>

10:30.717 --> 10:33.137
<b>I can't even begin
to imagine it.</b>

10:35.097 --> 10:38.107
<b>First, I need to
learn about them.</b>

10:38.147 --> 10:41.937
<b>Shira, teach me some
simple Mongolian words.</b>

10:41.987 --> 10:43.487
<b>I want to know their language.</b>

10:43.527 --> 10:46.647
<b>Sure. In return, I ask that
you help me in times of need.</b>

10:47.277 --> 10:48.527
<b>Of course I will.</b>

10:48.577 --> 10:50.827
<b>We're both on the same side,
aren't we?</b>

10:51.577 --> 10:55.577
<b>Everybody here
is my sworn enemy.</b>

10:57.247 --> 10:59.207
<b>As alone as I may be...</b>

10:59.247 --> 11:02.457
<b>I'll fight to the bitter end.</b>

11:12.677 --> 11:13.927
<b>[hoofbeats]</b>

11:13.977 --> 11:16.227
<b>[ÖGEDEI]
So, there you are, Töregene.</b>

11:16.267 --> 11:18.017
<b>It's Prince Ögedei.</b>

11:18.057 --> 11:19.767
<b>[attendant gasps softly]</b>

11:20.687 --> 11:23.317
<b>What? No words of appreciation</b>

11:23.357 --> 11:25.437
<b>for your husband who's returned
from battle?</b>

11:26.607 --> 11:28.317
<b>[TÖREGENE]
You are mistaken.</b>

11:28.367 --> 11:30.027
<b>I am not your wife.</b>

11:30.407 --> 11:32.237
<b>I am your enemy.</b>

11:41.707 --> 11:43.957
<b>[SITARA (ADULT)]
The year is 1221.</b>

11:44.257 --> 11:48.127
<b>The Mongol army has been resting
for a short time in Taloqan.</b>

11:49.387 --> 11:52.847
<b>But now, they are setting out
once again in the autumn.</b>

11:53.507 --> 11:56.847
<b>The army heads south
for the Khwarazmian Empire.</b>

11:57.427 --> 12:01.187
<b>They intend to swiftly vanquish
the empire's last ruler.</b>

12:02.607 --> 12:04.607
<b>The conflict
that ultimately follows</b>

12:04.647 --> 12:08.237
<b>will go down in history
as the Battle of the Indus.</b>

12:10.527 --> 12:12.657
<b>Less noticed by history,</b>

12:12.697 --> 12:15.327
<b>is that those taken captive
in Persia</b>

12:15.367 --> 12:18.867
<b>have continued their long march
to the Mongol home camp.</b>

12:18.907 --> 12:20.877
<b>It's been half of a year.</b>

12:20.917 --> 12:22.787
<b>How much longer
will this march take?</b>

12:22.837 --> 12:24.087
<b>-[SOLDIER] Halt!
-[ALL] Hm?</b>

12:24.127 --> 12:25.587
<b>[all sigh]</b>

12:26.877 --> 12:29.217
<b>[SOLDIER] Begin constructing
the gers immediately!</b>

12:29.257 --> 12:31.967
<b>An honored guest of the
Great Khan is heading here,</b>

12:32.007 --> 12:34.097
<b>traveling all the way
from the east.</b>

12:34.137 --> 12:35.807
<b>We are to set up camp
and provide him</b>

12:35.847 --> 12:37.177
<b>with lodging for the night.</b>

12:37.227 --> 12:39.177
<b>[cow moos]</b>

12:39.227 --> 12:41.307
<b>[indistinct chatter]</b>

12:45.017 --> 12:47.107
<b>-[SITARA] I help with this?
-[SOLDIER] Mm?</b>

12:47.147 --> 12:50.277
<b>No, this is a job for a man.</b>

12:55.777 --> 12:57.447
<b>Understand, yes.</b>

12:59.457 --> 13:01.827
<b>There's still much about
the Mongols' way of life</b>

13:01.867 --> 13:03.747
<b>that I find very puzzling.</b>

13:03.787 --> 13:06.917
<b>But I think I'm slowly
starting to understand it.</b>

13:06.957 --> 13:08.047
<b>♪</b>

13:09.297 --> 13:12.177
<b>They're all totally helpless
without me around.</b>

13:12.217 --> 13:14.797
<b>[SITARA] For example,
their tents are always built</b>

13:14.847 --> 13:16.717
<b>so that their entrances
are oriented south.</b>

13:16.757 --> 13:19.177
<b>Hey, you there! It's time
to water the livestock!</b>

13:19.227 --> 13:20.727
<b>[SITARA] In addition to that,</b>

13:20.767 --> 13:23.477
<b>they seem to follow
a rigorous daily schedule.</b>

13:25.147 --> 13:26.647
<b>[sighs]</b>

13:26.687 --> 13:27.777
<b>It makes me wonder</b>

13:28.187 --> 13:31.147
<b>how they're able to keep track
of the time so accurately.</b>

13:33.157 --> 13:34.407
<b>Uh?</b>

13:37.987 --> 13:40.497
<b>I see, a sundial...</b>

13:40.537 --> 13:42.667
<b>where the light falls
inside the house</b>

13:42.707 --> 13:44.167
<b>tells them what time it is.</b>

13:45.127 --> 13:46.287
<b>Hmm.</b>

13:46.667 --> 13:49.507
<b>It's quite clever to have
the whole house act as a clock.</b>

13:49.547 --> 13:50.547
<b>Uh?</b>

13:51.007 --> 13:53.547
<b>Although, an astrolabe
would be able to tell the time</b>

13:53.587 --> 13:54.967
<b>more precisely.</b>

13:55.007 --> 13:57.637
<b>This is nothing
but the wisdom of savages.</b>

13:59.597 --> 14:01.637
<b>[indistinct chatter]</b>

14:06.187 --> 14:07.477
<b>Have you heard?</b>

14:07.517 --> 14:10.067
<b>They say tonight's guest
is an Eastern sage</b>

14:10.107 --> 14:12.107
<b>who knows the secret
to immortality.</b>

14:12.147 --> 14:13.317
<b>Immortality?</b>

14:13.357 --> 14:14.737
<b>-[CHIEFTAIN] Excuse me.
-[ALL] Mm?</b>

14:14.777 --> 14:15.947
<b>Good evening, ladies.</b>

14:15.987 --> 14:18.277
<b>We are Uyghurs
from the city close to here.</b>

14:18.907 --> 14:21.497
<b>We come with an offering
for the master sage.</b>

14:21.537 --> 14:23.327
<b>Do you think you could show us
where he is?</b>

14:23.367 --> 14:25.577
<b>-Not me.
-I would be too scared.</b>

14:25.627 --> 14:26.787
<b>But why?</b>

14:27.037 --> 14:30.297
<b>[SITARA] The idea of an immortal
is rather creepy.</b>

14:30.337 --> 14:31.837
<b>But still...</b>

14:34.127 --> 14:35.877
<b>[SITARA]
Please follow this way.</b>

14:36.217 --> 14:38.257
<b>Huh? Oh, is that you, Chieftain?</b>

14:38.297 --> 14:42.727
<b>Oh-ho, Chinqai! I didn't realize
you were accompanying the sage.</b>

14:42.767 --> 14:46.187
<b>My apologies. I should call you
Lord Chinqai, shouldn't I?</b>

14:46.227 --> 14:47.727
<b>[laughs]
There's no need for that.</b>

14:47.767 --> 14:50.067
<b>You helped me out greatly
when I was a mere peddler.</b>

14:50.647 --> 14:52.817
<b>[CHIEFTAIN]
Gifts for the master sage.</b>

14:52.857 --> 14:56.277
<b>Wine, bread, and watermelon
from our city of Janbaliq.</b>

14:56.317 --> 14:57.947
<b>Oh, my! Watermelon!</b>

14:57.987 --> 14:59.907
<b>-These look wonderful.
-[Sitara exclaims]</b>

14:59.947 --> 15:01.197
<b>All right, go on ahead.</b>

15:01.237 --> 15:02.327
<b>[Sitara exclaims]</b>

15:02.577 --> 15:04.787
<b>[CHINQAI] Here.
You'll bring this in with them.</b>

15:05.077 --> 15:07.707
<b>Oh, but I... I don't...</b>

15:08.667 --> 15:10.417
<b>Go, now. Follow them.</b>

15:10.457 --> 15:11.627
<b>But...</b>

15:12.047 --> 15:14.087
<b>[breathes uneasily]</b>

15:14.547 --> 15:15.967
<b>[SITARA] An immortal?</b>

15:16.007 --> 15:18.887
<b>Can someone like that
really exist?</b>

15:18.927 --> 15:21.597
<b>I'll have to go see the truth
for myself.</b>

15:22.637 --> 15:23.767
<b>[chuckles softly]</b>

15:26.347 --> 15:27.977
<b>Allow me to introduce you.</b>

15:28.017 --> 15:29.727
<b>He was personally invited here</b>

15:29.767 --> 15:31.727
<b>by the Great Khan
to share his wisdom,</b>

15:31.767 --> 15:34.777
<b>and is currently in the midst
of a long journey to the west.</b>

15:34.817 --> 15:38.697
<b>This is Master Changchun,
the highly respected sage.</b>

15:38.737 --> 15:40.157
<b>[SITARA] How scary!</b>

15:40.197 --> 15:43.157
<b>He looks like he's been alive
for over 200 years!</b>

15:43.197 --> 15:45.497
<b>-The offering, if you will.
-[Sitara gasps]</b>

15:50.167 --> 15:52.587
<b>[Changchun mumbles]</b>

15:52.627 --> 15:54.047
<b>[INTERPRETER] Hm.</b>

15:54.087 --> 15:55.297
<b>Mm-hmm.</b>

15:55.337 --> 15:57.757
<b>Master Changchun asks you
the following...</b>

15:57.797 --> 16:00.337
<b>"Did anyone here
see the solar eclipse</b>

16:00.387 --> 16:02.217
<b>on the first day
of the fifth month?"</b>

16:02.257 --> 16:03.387
<b>[Sitara gasps]</b>

16:03.677 --> 16:05.427
<b>[CHIEFTAIN] The solar eclipse?</b>

16:05.477 --> 16:07.307
<b>Oh, yes,
there certainly was one.</b>

16:07.347 --> 16:08.887
<b>During the hour
of the snake.</b>

16:09.347 --> 16:12.557
<b>About seven-tenths of the sun
must have been obscured.</b>

16:12.607 --> 16:15.437
<b>-[SITARA] Mm... I, too.
-[ALL] Huh?</b>

16:15.487 --> 16:17.357
<b>[SITARA] I saw eclipse.</b>

16:17.397 --> 16:21.407
<b>On that day, travel passing
close to Samarkand.</b>

16:21.447 --> 16:23.407
<b>When sun began to hide.</b>

16:23.947 --> 16:26.697
<b>The sky grew slightly dark.</b>

16:26.747 --> 16:30.327
<b>And the sun, maybe six
in ten parts became hidden.</b>

16:30.367 --> 16:31.877
<b>[BOTH] Huh?</b>

16:33.167 --> 16:35.757
<b>[SITARA] Crescent shadows
through the trees.</b>

16:36.167 --> 16:37.967
<b>A solar eclipse.</b>

16:38.797 --> 16:41.547
<b>Master Muhammad might've kept
a record of this.</b>

16:42.087 --> 16:44.847
<b>But I don't even know
the exact time right now.</b>

16:44.887 --> 16:46.217
<b>Mm? [gasps softly]</b>

16:48.387 --> 16:51.267
<b>That time, light from sun...</b>

16:52.437 --> 16:56.607
<b>shone onto poles of the roof.
I saw, in the tent.</b>

16:56.647 --> 16:57.897
<b>Oh.</b>

16:58.067 --> 17:00.237
<b>[CHINQAI] That would signal
the hour of the dragon.</b>

17:00.277 --> 17:03.027
<b>Does that mean the eclipse
started later around here</b>

17:03.067 --> 17:04.117
<b>than where you were?</b>

17:04.327 --> 17:06.407
<b>When Master Changchun
witnessed the eclipse,</b>

17:06.447 --> 17:08.237
<b>he was staying near
the Kherlen River</b>

17:08.287 --> 17:09.367
<b>off to the east.</b>

17:09.407 --> 17:10.497
<b>That was midday.</b>

17:10.537 --> 17:11.877
<b>Even later, then.</b>

17:13.497 --> 17:16.797
<b>[INTERPRETER] He was still able
to see the stars in the sky.</b>

17:16.837 --> 17:20.257
<b>[CHIEFTAIN] Hm. So there are
different degrees of eclipsing?</b>

17:21.127 --> 17:22.547
<b>[CHANGCHUN] Hmm.</b>

17:22.587 --> 17:24.507
<b>[INTERPRETER]
"During a solar eclipse,</b>

17:24.547 --> 17:27.017
<b>the moon casts its shadow
over the sun.</b>

17:27.057 --> 17:28.717
<b>-One could liken it...
-[Sitara gasps]</b>

17:28.767 --> 17:31.637
<b>...to obstructing this flame
with a fan."</b>

17:31.937 --> 17:33.937
<b>-[Changchun mumbles]
-"From where I sit,</b>

17:33.977 --> 17:35.477
<b>the flame is not visible,</b>

17:35.517 --> 17:38.027
<b>but the rest of you see
a different picture."</b>

17:38.857 --> 17:42.697
<b>The world is indeed
a truly wide place.</b>

17:43.907 --> 17:45.027
<b>[cattle bleating]</b>

17:45.067 --> 17:46.367
<b>[CHINQAI] I'm sorry.</b>

17:46.527 --> 17:48.657
<b>I didn't realize that
you weren't part of their group.</b>

17:48.697 --> 17:51.157
<b>-[SITARA] Huh?
-My name is Chinqai.</b>

17:51.197 --> 17:52.707
<b>I'm a Uyghur as well.</b>

17:52.747 --> 17:54.707
<b>Though I was able
to pick up a bit of Persian</b>

17:54.747 --> 17:56.167
<b>back in my peddling days.</b>

17:57.247 --> 18:00.207
<b>Oh, my name is Fatima.
It is nice to meet you.</b>

18:00.257 --> 18:01.417
<b>I am traveling east</b>

18:01.757 --> 18:04.127
<b>so that I may someday serve
the consort of Prince Tolui.</b>

18:04.507 --> 18:06.797
<b>Is that so?
For Princess Sorghaghtani?</b>

18:06.847 --> 18:07.847
<b>[Sitara exhales]</b>

18:07.887 --> 18:10.097
<b>So you're her
lady-in-waiting, eh?</b>

18:10.137 --> 18:11.137
<b>That makes sense,</b>

18:11.307 --> 18:12.847
<b>considering the cleverness
you displayed.</b>

18:13.437 --> 18:15.097
<b>That's kind of you to say.</b>

18:15.937 --> 18:17.517
<b>And well, um...</b>

18:17.857 --> 18:19.527
<b>If I may ask,</b>

18:19.567 --> 18:22.147
<b>how old is the master sage,
exactly?</b>

18:23.067 --> 18:24.107
<b>Hmm.</b>

18:24.527 --> 18:27.027
<b>[CHINQAI] So you wish to know
more about immortality?</b>

18:27.367 --> 18:28.697
<b>Well, my apologies.</b>

18:28.737 --> 18:31.077
<b>Unfortunately, I can't reveal
his secret to you</b>

18:31.117 --> 18:33.117
<b>before the Great Khan learns it.</b>

18:34.577 --> 18:38.127
<b>[SITARA] No. I have no interest
in becoming immortal.</b>

18:38.167 --> 18:40.087
<b>-[CHINQAI] Hm?
-There was a story in a book</b>

18:40.127 --> 18:41.837
<b>that I read when I was younger.</b>

18:42.547 --> 18:46.387
<b>It was about a man who traveled
to India in search of longevity.</b>

18:46.427 --> 18:47.797
<b>But the men he found there</b>

18:47.847 --> 18:50.097
<b>took care of their fathers
and grandfathers</b>

18:50.137 --> 18:52.977
<b>who were too elderly
to even stand.</b>

18:53.017 --> 18:54.227
<b>And also...</b>

18:54.267 --> 18:55.637
<b>My great-grandfather,</b>

18:56.137 --> 18:57.807
<b>I must cover him
with this sheet,</b>

18:57.857 --> 18:59.567
<b>lest the rats nibble
away at him.</b>

18:59.607 --> 19:02.647
<b>But he is still alive,
and that is a blessing.</b>

19:03.317 --> 19:04.607
<b>[SITARA] Upon hearing this,</b>

19:04.647 --> 19:07.147
<b>the man no longer
sought an extended life.</b>

19:08.777 --> 19:11.737
<b>Instead of defying Allah
with immortality,</b>

19:11.787 --> 19:15.077
<b>it is far better to welcome
a healthy and natural death.</b>

19:15.117 --> 19:17.077
<b>That was the moral of the tale.</b>

19:17.127 --> 19:18.327
<b>[Chinqai chuckles]</b>

19:18.577 --> 19:20.287
<b>You know, on second thought,</b>

19:20.337 --> 19:22.247
<b>Master Changchun
did divulge it to me.</b>

19:22.297 --> 19:24.837
<b>-[SITARA] Uh?
-The secret to immortality.</b>

19:25.717 --> 19:26.927
<b>[Sitara breathes uneasily]</b>

19:26.967 --> 19:29.097
<b>You seem like
a very bright girl,</b>

19:29.137 --> 19:31.717
<b>so I'll make an exception
and tell you.</b>

19:32.217 --> 19:34.977
<b>The secret to immortality is...</b>

19:35.017 --> 19:36.477
<b>[Sitara whimpers]</b>

19:37.597 --> 19:38.897
<b>Nonexistent.</b>

19:38.937 --> 19:41.937
<b>We must all welcome
a healthy and natural death.</b>

19:42.267 --> 19:43.567
<b>[SITARA] Uh?</b>

19:43.897 --> 19:44.937
<b>[gasps softly]</b>

19:45.277 --> 19:48.197
<b>Seems sages can be found
in the East and the West.</b>

19:48.817 --> 19:52.407
<b>Our empire may be mighty,
but it's also young.</b>

19:52.447 --> 19:55.237
<b>There are many things
we have yet to learn.</b>

19:55.287 --> 19:58.407
<b>Fatima, such wisdom as yours
is something</b>

19:58.457 --> 20:00.537
<b>our people desperately need.</b>

20:02.287 --> 20:03.337
<b>[SITARA] Uh...</b>

20:03.377 --> 20:04.797
<b>[rain pouring]</b>

20:11.847 --> 20:13.927
<b>[SHIRA] A path to success
based on merit</b>

20:13.967 --> 20:15.307
<b>has opened up to us.</b>

20:16.387 --> 20:19.767
<b>[SITARA] I don't know.
What can someone like me do?</b>

20:20.597 --> 20:23.727
<b>That's why I'm leaving here
on a journey.</b>

20:24.937 --> 20:26.987
<b>[SITARA]
Thinking back to that time,</b>

20:28.567 --> 20:31.817
<b>why did I feel such frustration?</b>

20:33.117 --> 20:34.697
<b>[wind howling]</b>

20:39.657 --> 20:41.577
<b>Keep walking!
We're almost there!</b>

20:41.627 --> 20:43.627
<b>[all breathe heavily]</b>

20:45.547 --> 20:46.957
<b>[soldier sighs]</b>

20:48.167 --> 20:49.467
<b>We made it!</b>

20:49.507 --> 20:51.427
<b>[Sitara pants]</b>

20:54.807 --> 20:56.557
<b>[SITARA] Uh? [gasps]</b>

20:59.637 --> 21:02.687
<b>According to the map
by Al-Biruni I once saw,</b>

21:03.437 --> 21:06.897
<b>I now find myself
at the world's edge.</b>

21:12.907 --> 21:13.947
<b>[wind blows]</b>

21:13.987 --> 21:15.447
<b>[ALL] Cold!</b>

21:15.487 --> 21:17.907
<b>-I can't believe this chill!
-I'm freezing!</b>

21:18.787 --> 21:20.497
<b>[LADY-IN-WAITING] Put these on.</b>

21:20.537 --> 21:23.077
<b>Welcome to
Princess Sorghaghtani's orda.</b>

21:23.127 --> 21:25.287
<b>Her Highness made certain
to supply coats</b>

21:25.337 --> 21:27.417
<b>and warm gers
in preparation for your arrival.</b>

21:27.457 --> 21:29.007
<b>[all gasp]</b>

21:29.417 --> 21:30.967
<b>[indistinct chatter]</b>

21:35.427 --> 21:37.597
<b>Are any of you girls named
Fatima?</b>

21:37.637 --> 21:39.017
<b>[SITARA] Huh?</b>

21:43.347 --> 21:46.397
<b>[LADY] Princess Sorghaghtani.
I've brought the girl.</b>

21:52.737 --> 21:54.407
<b>[SORGHAGHTANI]
You have my thanks...</b>

21:55.367 --> 21:57.287
<b>...for making the long journey
all the way here in this cold.</b>

21:58.367 --> 21:59.487
<b>[Sitara gasps]</b>

22:00.867 --> 22:02.117
<b>How exciting!</b>

22:02.327 --> 22:04.537
<b>You're the one who will be
teaching me this book, yes?</b>

22:05.207 --> 22:07.747
<b>[Sitara gasps]</b>

22:08.497 --> 22:11.167
<b>[♪ closing theme song playing]</b>

23:38.587 --> 23:40.797
<b>[SITARA] Next time, "Otchigin."</b>
